{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_17761","headline":"和元员外题昇平里新斋 · 杨巨源","name":"和元员外题昇平里新斋","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"自知休沐诸幽胜，遂肯高斋枕广衢。\n旧地已开新玉圃，春山仍展绿云图。\n心源邀得闲诗证，肺气宜将慢酒扶。\n此外唯应任真宰，同尘敢是道门枢。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"杨巨源","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_17761.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_17761","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}